{"kind":"table","sheet":"Guide","address":"A1:B19","rows":19,"cols":2,"values":[[null,null],["Using your inventory tracker",null],[null,null],["Setup","One stock pool per SKU. Add SKUs and products in Inventory, then enter opening on-hand, reserved and reorder quantities."],["Opening balance","Use counts at one agreed cutover time. Append only movements occurring after that time. Enter 0 for no reserved units."],["Daily use","Append rows to Movements. Inventory recalculates from opening balances plus valid movements. Never overwrite calculated cells."],["Reserve an order","For 1 unit ordered: on hand change 0; reserved change +1. Available stock decreases by 1."],["Ship that order","On hand change -1; reserved change -1. This avoids deducting available stock twice."],["Cancel before shipping","On hand change 0; reserved change -1. Only release units that were actually reserved."],["Receive / usable return","On hand change +quantity; reserved change 0. Add returns only after inspection and receipt."],["Immediate sale","For sales with no reservation workflow: on hand change -quantity; reserved change 0. Do not also reserve the same sale."],["Adjustments","Enter signed corrections after a physical count. Include a reason and operator."],["Event IDs","One stable unique ID per event line, such as store:order:line:reserve. Repeated IDs after the first row are excluded."],["Errors","Only OK movement rows affect stock. Resolve missing inputs, unknown SKUs and duplicates before relying on balances."],["Automation","Not connected yet. Configure n8n to append A:J only, populate numeric deltas including zero, and use stable event IDs."],["Concurrency","Have n8n append movements sequentially. Avoid read-then-overwrite stock counts. Reconcile against the store regularly."],["Capacity","Prepared for 200 SKUs and 1,000 movements. Extend formulas, validations, tables and all summary ranges before exceeding these limits."],["Google Sheets","After import, verify stock balances in Google Sheets before connecting live store events."],["Scope","This template does not track purchase orders or incoming stock. It starts blank and contains no real store data."]]}
